{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测对互联网疑似ICMP隧道。对应需求：命令控制。官方：Potential ICMP Tunneling Activity to the Internet。","from":"now-9m","index":["logs-network_traffic.icmp-*"],"language":"kuery","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】对互联网疑似ICMP隧道","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\n对互联网疑似ICMP隧道\n\n### 为何重要\n建立外连、隧道或远控通道\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","references":["https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1572/","https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc792","https://www.levelblue.com/blogs/spiderlabs-blog/backdoor-at-the-end-of-the-icmp-tunnel"],"risk_score":47,"rule_id":"96dd08d8-8f3d-4f55-ada8-7dc1e05dbd47","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 接入边界或主机网络日志（Packetbeat、防火墙、云流量等，按规则数据源）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: 网络","主题: 命令控制","来源: 默认","对应需求: 命令控制"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"new_terms","query":"data_stream.dataset:network_traffic.icmp\n  and (network_traffic.icmp.request.type:(8 or 128) or icmp.request.type:(8 or 128))\n  and network.transport:(icmp or ipv6-icmp)\n  and source.ip:(10.0.0.0/8 or 172.16.0.0/12 or 192.168.0.0/16 or \"FC00::/7\")\n  and network.bytes >= 256\n  and not destination.ip:(\n    10.0.0.0/8 or 100.64.0.0/10 or 127.0.0.0/8 or 169.254.0.0/16 or 172.16.0.0/12 or 192.168.0.0/16 or\n    192.0.0.0/24 or 192.0.0.0/29 or 192.0.0.8/32 or 192.0.0.9/32 or 192.0.0.10/32 or 192.0.0.170/32 or\n    192.0.0.171/32 or 192.0.2.0/24 or 192.175.48.0/24 or 192.31.196.0/24 or 192.52.193.0/24 or 192.88.99.0/24 or\n    198.18.0.0/15 or 198.51.100.0/24 or 203.0.113.0/24 or 224.0.0.0/4 or 240.0.0.0/4 or \"::1\" or \"FC00::/7\" or\n    \"FE80::/10\" or \"FF00::/8\"\n  )\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1095","name":"Non-Application Layer Protocol","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1095/"},{"id":"T1572","name":"Protocol Tunneling","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1572/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0011","name":"Command and Control","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0011/"}}],"new_terms_fields":["source.ip","destination.ip"],"history_window_start":"now-7d","false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"network_traffic","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","source.ip","destination.ip","destination.port","network.protocol","network.direction","tls.server.x509.subject.common_name","dns.question.name","host.name","user.name","message"]},"version":2,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
